{{casting|name=Beach Bomb Too|series=[[HotWheelsCollectors.com Series 1|HWC.com 1]]|image=2002hwcbeachbombtoopink.jpg|years=[[2002]] - [[2007]]|designer=[[Larry Wood]]|number=85519}}
==Description==
The '''Beach Bomb Too''' is a Hot Wheels original design primarily made as HotWheelsCollectors.com exclusives. While bearing similarities to the [[Volkswagen Beach Bomb]] prototype casting released in 1969 down to lacking the Volkswagen logo on the front, it is a completely new tool which covers the window panels. In 2003, the tooling was updated to have its rear panels widened, similar to the final product of the original Beach Bomb.

The first run of the Beach Bomb Too #14 was advertised as being purple, but due to an error in the paint process the paint turned out to be a pink hue.

Later derivatives of the Beach Bomb design would use the Beach Bomb Too's base.

